<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ross Mining in funding pact for mine.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ross Mining in funding pact for mine.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Mining NL said on Tuesday it has reached an agreement with the Commonwealth Development Corp of Britain for $US23 million in limited recourse facilities to fund development of the the Gold Ridge mining project in the Solomon Islands.</p>
<p>The funding comprises a US$18 million eight-year facility and a US$5 million five-year convertible note, Ross Mining said.</p>
<p>Ross Mining said it expects to start construction of the gold mining project in March 1997, pending the completion of a feasibility study and execution of a government mining lease.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
